{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 11 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">物理约束重建：从后处理到展开优化与测量一致性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Physics-Informed Recon</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_051_varnet-title\">VarNet</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">灵敏度估计网络加多级 k-space variational cascades，将图像正则与采样点 DC 工程化为统一流程。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">End-to-End Variational Network combining a joint U-Net coil sensitivity estimation module (SME) with K k-space variational cascades using U-Net image regularizers.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">欠采样多线圈 k-space y 与采样掩膜 M</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Raw undersampled multi-coil k-space y and Cartesian undersampling mask M (including auto-calibration lines)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">灵敏度组合后的 MRI 幅度图 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Root-sum-of-squares or coil-combined MRI magnitude image x̂</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.06688\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_051_varnet')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_051_varnet')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"VarNet original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/db3c4e3c341eb3302e40.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_051_varnet\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_051_varnet')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_051_varnet\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">多线圈 k-space</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Multi-Coil k-Space</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">原始欠采样 y，采样位置由 M 标记</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests raw undersampled multi-coil k-space y and cartesian undersampling mask m (including auto-calibration lines) and prepares initial tensor representations (Multi-Coil k-Space).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"原始欠采样 y，采样位置由 M 标记\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests raw undersampled multi-coil k-space y and cartesian undersampling mask m (including auto-calibration lines) and prepares initial tensor representations (Multi-Coil k-Space).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"多线圈 k-space\" data-node-name-en=\"Multi-Coil k-Space\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多线圈 k-space</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Multi-Coil k-Space</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">原始欠采样 y，采样位置由 M 标记</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests raw undersampled multi-coil k-space y and cartesian undersampling mask m (including auto-calibration lines) and prepares initial tensor representations (Multi-Coil k-Space).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从中心 k-space 估计并归一化 coil sensitivity maps S\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Sensitivity Map Network to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"灵敏度网络\" data-node-name-en=\"Sensitivity Map Network\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">灵敏度网络</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Sensitivity Map Network</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从中心 k-space 估计并归一化 coil sensitivity maps S</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Sensitivity Map Network to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"A=PFS；A* 逆 FFT 后按 S* 做 sensitivity reduction\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs A / A* within the core cascaded kspace variational network computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"A / A*\" data-node-name-en=\"A / A*\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>A / A*</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">A=PFS；A* 逆 FFT 后按 S* 做 sensitivity reduction</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs A / A* within the core cascaded kspace variational network computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个 cascade 维护完整多线圈频域估计 k_t\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs k-space within the core cascaded kspace variational network computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"k-space 状态\" data-node-name-en=\"k-space\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">k-space 状态</span><span class=\"lang-en\">k-space</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个 cascade 维护完整多线圈频域估计 k_t</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs k-space within the core cascaded kspace variational network computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"A* 折叠到图像域，经 U-Net 后由 A 展回多线圈 k-space\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs regularization within the core cascaded kspace variational network computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"图像正则器\" data-node-name-en=\"regularization\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像正则器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">regularization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">A* 折叠到图像域，经 U-Net 后由 A 展回多线圈 k-space</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs regularization within the core cascaded kspace variational network computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"M(k_t-y) 的软数据一致性更新\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Sampled k-Space DC within the core cascaded kspace variational network computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"采样点 DC\" data-node-name-en=\"Sampled k-Space DC\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">采样点 DC</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Sampled k-Space DC</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">M(k_t-y) 的软数据一致性更新</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Sampled k-Space DC within the core cascaded kspace variational network computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每级执行 k_{t+1}=k_t-eta_t M(k_t-y)-A R_t(A* k_t)，构成固定深度 variational cascade\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies K unrolled iterative to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"K 级展开迭代\" data-node-name-en=\"K unrolled iterative\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">K 级展开迭代</span><span class=\"lang-en\">K unrolled iterative</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每级执行 k_{t+1}=k_t-eta_t M(k_t-y)-A R_t(A* k_t)，构成固定深度 variational cascade</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies K unrolled iterative to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"最终 k-space 逆 FFT 后做 root-sum-of-squares\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces root-sum-of-squares or coil-combined mri magnitude image x̂ via RSS.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"RSS 图像\" data-node-name-en=\"RSS\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_051_varnet', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">RSS 图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">RSS</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">最终 k-space 逆 FFT 后做 root-sum-of-squares</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces root-sum-of-squares or coil-combined mri magnitude image x̂ via RSS.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"VarNet Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · k-space 软数据一致性级联更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · End-to-End Sensitivity Map Estimation + k-Space Variational Cascades</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"VarNet：核心公式 · k-space 软数据一致性级联更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"51\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"10.042222pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.463784 -68.962636 212.897912 10.042222\" width=\"212.897912pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.85475 0V-.108683C2.282351-.115929 2.166422-.188385 2.166422-.536171V-4.883507L2.108458-4.897998L.804257-4.238652V-4.137214C.891204-4.173442 .970905-4.202424 .999887-4.21691