n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">多线圈 benchmark、coil handling 和训练流程碎片化</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Prior unrolled MRI methods depended on external offline ESPIRiT coil maps that broke down under narrow calibration regions or motion.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">多级 learned regularizer 与 k-space data consistency 交替，并估计 coil sensitivity maps</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Estimate smooth coil sensitivity maps end-to-end from low-frequency ACS k-space via a dedicated U-Net, feeding directly into K k-space variational U-Net cascades.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把 variational cascade 工程化到 fastMRI 原始 k-space 标准评测</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Self-contained raw-k-space-to-image pipeline standardized on the public fastMRI multi-coil benchmark.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">形成公开 MRI 重建基线；同类变分/展开式 AI reconstruction 另有前瞻膝 MRI 诊断等效证据</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">De facto public benchmark champion and baseline for accelerated multi-coil knee and brain MRI reconstruction.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">长期价值已证明；前瞻证据不等同于公开 VarNet 本身，且显存、采样 mask 和厂商域移位仍需验证</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Proven long-term value; high GPU memory during unrolled training and sensitivity to out-of-distribution k-space sampling patterns remain key considerations.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把 coil sensitivity estimation、图像域正则器和 k-space 数据一致性纳入同一端到端级联。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">每级在 A*/A 之间往返，使卷积先验工作在组合图像域，而残差在真实采样 k-space 上计算。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">soft data consistency 允许网络学习采样点更新强度，并非简单硬替换。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Estimate smooth coil sensitivity maps end-to-end from low-frequency ACS k-space via a dedicated U-Net, feeding directly into K k-space variational U-Net cascades.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Self-contained raw-k-space-to-image pipeline standardized on the public fastMRI multi-coil benchmark.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: End-to-End Sensitivity Map Estimation + k-Space Variational Cascades.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">为 fastMRI 多线圈原始数据提供可复现的强基线，便于比较采样 mask 和加速因子。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">公开 VarNet 的离线指标不能替代前瞻诊断验证；coil map、厂商与序列域移位仍需单独评估。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: De facto public benchmark champion and baseline for accelerated multi-coil knee and brain MRI reconstruction.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Proven long-term value; high GPU memory during unrolled training and sensitivity to out-of-distribution k-space sampling patterns remain key considerations.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.06688\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>End-to-End Variational Networks for Accelerated MRI Reconstruction</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/fastMRI/tree/main/fastmri_examples/varnet\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}